          "docs": "Get full cloud-bill (TCO) trends over time, stacked by infrastructure\ncategory (Compute / Storage / Networking / Database / Security /\nAnalytics & Streaming, plus an ``Other`` catch-all).\n\nOne row per period; each category is a numeric field, plus a synthetic\n``__cloud_cost_total__`` and per-period percentage-change fields. Powers the\nSummary \"Cloud Costs\" tab and the Jobs \"Cloud Costs\" group-by. Returns ``[]``\nfor tenants without the cloud-cost feed."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get cloud infrastructure cost projection (actual + month-end estimate)",
            "type": "http"
          },
